{"articleNo":"631","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=631&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"재학생 기숙사 1차 추가합격자 발표(대학원 포함)","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2009.02.04","hit":"14994","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><font color=\"#000000\"><font size=\"4\">2009-1학기 재학생 1차 추가&nbsp;합격자를 <font color=\"#dc143c\"><strong>원스톱서비스에 발표하였습니다.</strong></font></font></font></p>\n<p><font size=\"4\"><font color=\"#000000\">로그인하여 합격여부를 확인하시고 </font><font color=\"#000000\">납부기간에 등록하시기 바랍니다.</font></font></p>\n<p><font color=\"#dc143c\"><font size=\"4\"><strong>납부기간에 등록하지 않을 경우&nbsp;입사의사가 없는것으로 간주합니다.(차순위자 선발)</strong>&nbsp;</font></font></p>\n<p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"4\"></font>&nbsp;</p>\n<font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\">\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font size=\"4\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<font size=\"5\"> </font></font></font><font color=\"#00008b\" size=\"5\"><strong>1차 추가 납부기간 : 2009. 2. 6(금) ～ 2. 10(화)&nbsp;</strong></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font color=\"#000000\"></font></span>&nbsp;</p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font color=\"#000000\"></font></span>&nbsp;</p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">- 2차 발표 :&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">2009. 2. 11(수) 14 : 00</span></font></p>\n<p class=\"HStyl